18:T594,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"When do Erasmus Mundus 2027 applications open?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Many programmes accept applications between October and January, but each consortium publishes its own opening date and deadline. Check the selected programme website."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Erasmus Mundus fully funded?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Top candidates may receive EU-funded scholarships that support participation, travel, visa and living expenses. Exact coverage and personal costs must be checked for the current programme."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can final-year bachelor's students apply?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"They may be able to apply if they will graduate before the master's programme begins and meet the consortium's evidence requirements."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I apply on one central Erasmus portal?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Applications are submitted directly to the institution or consortium running the selected Joint Master, using its official process."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can Pakistani students apply for Erasmus Mundus?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Programmes are open globally in principle, but every Pakistani applicant must meet the selected consortium's academic, language and document rules."}}]}1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"$undefined","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/scholarships/erasmus-mundus/\",\"name\":\"Erasmus Mundus Joint Masters scholarships 2027\",\"description\":\"Learn how Erasmus Mundus Joint Masters applications work, when 2027 programmes usually open, what scholarships may cover and how to apply.\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/scholarships/erasmus